<section class="section page-intro">
  <h1>A public home for living seed collections</h1>
  <p>Seedexchange connects approved organizations, responsible sellers and growers without forcing every collection into a conventional shop.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Directory first</h2>
  <p>Seed banks, botanic gardens, nurseries, growers, shops and collectors receive a durable public profile with provenance, specialties and contact information.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Commerce where it belongs</h2>
  <p>Approved commercial organizations can publish reviewed products. Exchange and donation listings remain separate and free.</p>
</section>
